
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020" />

  <title>Stripe Connection Failed</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --bg: #0b1020;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --muted: #9aa9bf;
      --red: #f87171;
      --red-bright: #ef4444;
      --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);
      --purple: #a5a0ff;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          ellipse at 50% 0%,
          rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12),
          transparent 55%
        ),
        var(--bg);
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 510px;
      padding: 42px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(
        160deg,
        rgba(28, 29, 48, 0.98),
        rgba(14, 22, 39, 0.98)
      );
      border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.2);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 28px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      animation: enter 0.5s ease-out;
    }

    .icon-wrap {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin: 0 auto 22px;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f05252, #b91c1c);
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18);
    }

    .icon-wrap svg {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      fill: none;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 2.3;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: #fca5a5;
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.09);
      border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.22);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .badge-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      background: var(--red-bright);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: clamp(25px, 5vw, 32px);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .description {
      max-width: 390px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      border: 0;
      background: var(--border);
    }

    .reasons {
      padding: 21px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      text-align: left;
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.045);
      border: 1px solid rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.15);
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    .reasons-title {
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      color: #fca5a5;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .reason {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 11px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .reason:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .reason-icon {
      width: 19px;
      height: 19px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin-top: 1px;
      color: var(--red);
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .help-text {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 11px;
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 49px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        background 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button svg {
      width: 17px;
      height: 17px;
      fill: none;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 2;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .button-primary {
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #dc2626);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.16);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.24);
    }

    .button-secondary {
      color: #dbe4f0;
      background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.05);
      border-color: var(--border);
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
    }

    .button:focus-visible,
    .support-link:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #a5a0ff;
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 27px;
      color: #718096;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .support-link {
      color: var(--purple);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .support-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .stripe-brand {
      color: var(--purple);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    }

    @keyframes enter {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(14px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      body {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 30px 22px;
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      .icon-wrap {
        width: 66px;
        height: 66px;
        border-radius: 19px;
      }

      .divider {
        margin: 24px 0;
      }

      .reasons {
        padding: 17px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="icon-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M18 6 6 18" />
        <path d="m6 6 12 12" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      Connection incomplete
    </div>

    <h1>Let's get you connected.</h1>

    <p class="description">
      We couldn't complete your Stripe account connection.
      This can happen if you cancelled the setup or left some
      required information incomplete. Your connection may still
      be resumable from your dashboard.
    </p>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="reasons" aria-label="Troubleshooting">
      <h2 class="reasons-title">What might have happened?</h2>

      <div class="reason">
        <span class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
        <span>The onboarding form was not fully completed.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="reason">
        <span class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
        <span>Some required identity or business documents are missing.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="reason">
        <span class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
        <span>You cancelled the process or closed the browser before finishing.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="reason">
        <span class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
        <span>Stripe needs additional information to verify your account or bank details.</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="help-text">
      Return to your dashboard to resume the onboarding process.
      If the problem continues, our support team can help.
    </p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a
        class="button button-primary"
        href="https://finlara.co.uk/apply/business"
      >
        Try Again
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20 7v5h-5" />
          <path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-2.3-5.7L20 9" />
        </svg>
      </a>

      <a
        class="button button-secondary"
        href="https://finlara.co.uk"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="m3 10 9-7 9 7" />
          <path d="M5 9v12h14V9" />
          <path d="M9 21v-7h6v7" />
        </svg>
        Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
      Need help?
      <a
        class="support-link"
        href="mailto:support@revenuefinancing.com"
      >support@revenuefinancing.com</a>

      <p>
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Revenue Financing.
        All rights reserved.
      </p>

      <p>Payments infrastructure by <span class="stripe-brand">stripe</span></p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
